== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: tcmmrlfp16ps [ENC: VEX, MAP: 0F38, OPC: 0x6C]
     LENGTH:  5
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AMX_TILE
    ISA-SET: AMX_COMPLEX
    ISA-EXT: AMX_TILE
 EXCEPTIONS: AMXE4
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_VEX 
  OPTIMIZED: C4 E2 48 6C E5 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT      RW     MODRM_REG   8192    256      32   FLOAT32                         tmm4
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM   8192    256      32   FLOAT16                         tmm5
 2   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R        NDSNDD   8192    256      32   FLOAT16                         tmm6
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 128
  BROADCAST: NONE

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: tcmmrlfp16ps %tmm6, %tmm5, %tmm4
   RELATIVE: tcmmrlfp16ps %tmm6, %tmm5, %tmm4

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: tcmmrlfp16ps tmm4, tmm5, tmm6
   RELATIVE: tcmmrlfp16ps tmm4, tmm5, tmm6

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
C4 E2 48 6C E5 
:        :  :..MODRM
:        :..OPCODE
:..VEX
